    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Job description:\n{{ $('On form submission').item.json['Job Description'] || $('On form submission').item.json['Job description'] }}\n\nCV:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nSteps:\n1. Extract the key required skills from the job description (max 15).\n2. Find the years of experience the job asks for (use 0 if none is mentioned).\n3. Work out the candidate's total relevant work experience in years from the CV (internships count; use decimals, e.g. 0.5).\n4. Call the check_cv_fit tool with the full CV text, the skill list, required_years and candidate_years.\n5. Give your own fit rating out of 100 based on the CV and job.\n6. Final score = average of the tool score and your rating.\n\nReply with: tool score, skill score, experience score and note, your rating, final score, matched skills, missing skills (gaps), and a 2-line summary.",
        "options": {}
