    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Email from: {{ $json.from.text }}\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\nBody: {{ $json.text }}\n\nDecide if this email is about a job application I made. If it is not job related, reply only \"IGNORE\" and call no tools.\n\nJob alerts, job recommendations and newsletters (for example \"new jobs for you\", \"10 more jobs\", \"jobs you may like\") are NOT my applications. Reply only \"IGNORE\" for these and call no tools.\n\nIf it is about my own application, classify it as exactly one of: confirmation, interview, rejected, offer.\n\nRules:\n- confirmation (they received my application): call add_application with the company, role and status \"applied\".\n- interview, rejected or offer: first call update_status with the company name and the status word.\n- If update_status says 0 rows were updated, the company is not saved yet, so call add_application with the company, role and that same status.\n\nUse only the company name, for example \"Intuji\", not \"Intuji Pvt Ltd\".\nReply with one short line saying what you did.",
